{"slug": "nerdwallet", "name": "NerdWallet", "category": "Fintech & Crypto", "summary": "Personal finance comparison platform. Deep spruce green, mint washes, near-square corners", "description": "An analysis of NerdWallet's design language — a personal-finance comparison platform built almost entirely from one deep green and a ladder of mints beneath it. Editorial pages open on a green gradient band, then drop to near-white where dense comparison tables do the real work. Corners are almost square, shadows are nearly absent, and the whole system separates content with hairlines and pale mint washes rather than elevation.", "colors": [{"name": "Spruce", "hex": "#008254", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary", "role": "the brand. It fills `{button-primary}`, `{icon-circle-active}`, rating stars and every in-body green link, and it is the base of the editorial hero gradient. By pixel volume it is the single most-used non-neutral in the system."}, {"name": "Deep Spruce", "hex": "#006642", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-deep", "role": "the fill of `{stat-block-dark}`, the dark statistic panel that sits inside the mint expert-tip callout."}, {"name": "Forest", "hex": "#00482f", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "forest", "role": "the deepest green, used where the hero gradient lands darkest and on dense editorial chrome."}, {"name": "Logo Lime", "hex": "#8dc63f", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "logo-lime", "role": "the lime inside the wordmark's leading mark. It appears at small scale on every page and nowhere else."}, {"name": "Hero Lime", "hex": "#9ae600", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "lime-hero", "role": "the vivid lime that sets the brand name inside the homepage hero headline — one word, once per page."}, {"name": "Panel Lime", "hex": "#e8fdac", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "lime-panel", "role": "the fill of `{expert-tip-panel}` and the colour of `{editorial-badge}` text on the green band."}, {"name": "Accent Lime", "hex": "#ddfa88", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "lime-accent", "role": "a brighter lime used for highlight marks on the comparison pages."}, {"name": "Ribbon Lime", "hex": "#a8ea4c", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "lime-ribbon", "role": "the lime end of the `{marquee-ribbon}` gradient — the only place the lime family covers a large surface."}, {"name": "Canvas", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "the page, the nav bar and every card."}, {"name": "Soft Canvas", "hex": "#f7f7f7", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-soft", "role": "the page tint behind long comparison pages and the fill of `{button-secondary}`. It carries more area than any other surface on the savings page."}, {"name": "Mint 50", "hex": "#effcf8", "group": "Surface", "token": "mint-50", "role": "the palest wash, used for `{section-panel-mint}` and `{icon-circle-inactive}`."}, {"name": "Mint 100", "hex": "#e3faf2", "group": "Surface", "token": "mint-100", "role": "one step up, used for `{media-frame-mint}` and `{award-ribbon-pill}`."}, {"name": "Mint 200", "hex": "#b7ecda", "group": "Surface", "token": "mint-200", "role": "the most saturated mint, reserved for small emphasis fills."}, {"name": "Hairline", "hex": "#ebebec", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline", "role": "rules between table rows and inside cards."}, {"name": "Strong Hairline", "hex": "#d8d9da", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline-strong", "role": "the visible border on `{product-card}` and `{button-outline}`."}, {"name": "Ink", "hex": "#000000", "group": "Text", "token": "ink", "role": "every heading and product name. Pure black, not softened."}, {"name": "Body", "hex": "#3d4045", "group": "Text", "token": "body", "role": "running copy and `{spec-cell}` labels."}, {"name": "Muted", "hex": "#64666a", "group": "Text", "token": "muted", "role": "captions, disclosure lines and `{eyebrow-label}`."}, {"name": "Faint", "hex": "#b1b3b5", "group": "Text", "token": "faint", "role": "the quietest tier, used 